Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:06.16,Chinese,C06-01-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}带回一次普通行军，可以按出发前、途中、接战前三个时点检查。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:06.16,English,C06-01-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}For an ordinary march, use three checkpoints: before departure, en route, and before battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:12.03,Chinese,C06-01-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}每次先确认哪支军队、哪个日期、哪个地点，再看数字。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:12.03,English,C06-01-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}Identify the army, date, and location before reading the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:19.03,Chinese,C06-01-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}不同日期和地点可以比较，但不要拼成一个看似同时存在的军队状态。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:19.03,English,C06-01-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}Different dates and places can be compared,\Nbut should not be combined into one apparently simultaneous army state.
